request.description:
Get full entity data by Q-number. Returns labels, descriptions, aliases, statements (properties), sitelinks.

Replace Q223522 with any entity ID from search results.

Key response shape:
- type: 'item'
- labels: { en: 'Kansas City Chiefs', es: '...', ... }
- descriptions: { en: 'National Football League franchise...' }
- aliases: { en: ['Dallas Texans', 'KC Chiefs', 'Chiefs'] }
- statements: { P31: [...], P118: [...], ... } (property claims)
- sitelinks: { enwiki: { title: '...' }, ... }

urlencoded.value:
SELECT ?item ?itemLabel ?itemDescription WHERE {
  VALUES ?item { wd:Q223522 wd:Q1215884 wd:Q178169 }
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "[AUTO_LANGUAGE],en" . }
}
LIMIT 10

